[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doctrine/orm/issues/comments/214864357","html_url":"https://github.com/doctrine/orm/issues/5684#issuecomment-214864357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doctrine/orm/issues/5684","id":214864357,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxNDg2NDM1Nw==","user":{"login":"OJezu","id":3941091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDEwOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3941091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu","html_url":"https://github.com/OJezu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-04-26T19:47:09Z","updated_at":"2016-04-26T19:47:22Z","body":"I would like to add, that even if you try to create your own generator that will convert the value, well too bad, because doctrine is hardcoded to add autoincrement only when generated value strategy is identity. If you try to roll your own, its impossible to have autoincrement on your columns.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doctrine/orm/issues/comments/214864357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"OJezu","id":3941091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDEwOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3941091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu","html_url":"https://github.com/OJezu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OJezu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doctrine/orm/issues/comments/232500035","html_url":"https://github.com/doctrine/orm/issues/5684#issuecomment-232500035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doctrine/orm/issues/5684","id":232500035,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzMjUwMDAzNQ==","user":{"login":"mantiz","id":838666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODY2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/838666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz","html_url":"https://github.com/mantiz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-07-13T22:01:26Z","updated_at":"2016-07-14T05:22:22Z","body":"I encountered the same problem today. A small debugging session pointed me to https://github.com/doctrine/doctrine2/blob/2b476708311b6003881a0cb944ca8c1bf996d58a/lib/Doctrine/ORM/UnitOfWork.php#L1016 where the value of the id generator gets directly assigned.\n\nI made a few quick changes directly below the linked line and it seems to work well. The changes are:\n\n``` php\n$platform = $this->em->getConnection()->getDatabasePlatform();\n$idType = $this->em->getClassMetadata(get_class($entity))->fieldMappings[$idField]['type'];\n$mappedId = Types\\Type::getType($idType)->convertToPHPValue($id, $platform);\n\n$class->reflFields[$idField]->setValue($entity, $mappedId);\n```\n\nThe `Types` namespace, of course, was used by `use Doctrine\\DBAL\\Types`.\n\nI'm not sure if this has any relevant performance (or other) issues.\n\nIf someone could confirm that these changes are reasonable, I would be happy to submit a pull request within the next days. Just let me know. :wink: \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/doctrine/orm/issues/comments/232500035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mantiz","id":838666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODY2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/838666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz","html_url":"https://github.com/mantiz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mantiz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mant